Package: retractionwatch
Title: Analysis of Retraction Watch Data by Country Group
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Miquel", "Perello Nieto", , "mp15688@bristol.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions to load, clean and analyse the Retraction Watch
    dataset together with SCImago country publication counts. Includes
    retraction rates by country group under several filtering scenarios,
    comparisons of retraction reasons between groups, and analyses of
    AI-related retractions.
